# Keep Docker build contexts (api/Dockerfile, fleet/Dockerfile — both built from
# the repo root) small, and keep CDK asset staging off node_modules (the Windows
# junction api/node_modules/@plumetrace/contracts breaks `cdk synth` copy).
**/node_modules
.git
.github
.venv
venv
cdk.out
infra/cdk.out
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
.pytest_cache
.local-s3
web/dist
**/.DS_Store
*.log
